  "rows": [
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "突然『挑戦状』が届いて、\nおふたりは動揺していませんか？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_01_d:step-2:text",
        "step_id": 2,
        "step_index": 1,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_01_d",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_01_d.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 31,
          "target_step_index": 1
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "うーん、おじさんだしねぇ。\nちょっとやそっとのことじゃ動揺しないかも。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "山下 次郎"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_01_d:step-3:text",
        "step_id": 3,
        "step_index": 2,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_01_d",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_01_d.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 31,
          "target_step_index": 2
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "そうだな、歳を重ねてるってのもあるが……",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "葛之葉 雨彦"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_01_d:step-4:text",
        "step_id": 4,
        "step_index": 3,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_01_d",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_01_d.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 31,
          "target_step_index": 3
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "この事務所にいると、\n毎日新鮮なことばかりだからな。慣れてきたさ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "葛之葉 雨彦"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_01_d:step-5:text",
        "step_id": 5,
        "step_index": 4,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_01_d",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_01_d.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 31,
          "target_step_index": 4
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "それにJIFのおかげで、\n全員がアイドルとしていい経験を積めたはずだ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "葛之葉 雨彦"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_01_d:step-6:text",
        "step_id": 6,
        "step_index": 5,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_01_d",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_01_d.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 31,
          "target_step_index": 5
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "今回も乗り越えられるだろう。\nお前さんもいるしな。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "葛之葉 雨彦"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_01_d:step-7:text",
        "step_id": 7,
        "step_index": 6,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_01_d",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_01_d.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 31,
          "target_step_index": 6
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "そうそう、みんながいれば今回も大丈夫！\nだから、今は二次会が最優先！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "山下 次郎"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_01_d:step-8:text",
        "step_id": 8,
        "step_index": 7,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_01_d",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_01_d.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 31,
          "target_step_index": 7
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "お互いの労を労わないとね。……ってことで、\n●●●●プロデューサーちゃんも二次会来るでしょ？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "山下 次郎"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_01_d:step-9:text",
        "step_id": 9,
        "step_index": 8,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_01_d",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_01_d.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 31,
          "target_step_index": 8
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ありがとうございます。参加させてください！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_01_d:step-10:text",
        "step_id": 10,
        "step_index": 9,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_01_d",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_01_d.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 31,
          "target_step_index": 9
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "よし、決まりだな。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "葛之葉 雨彦"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_01_d:step-11:text",
        "step_id": 11,
        "step_index": 10,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_01_d",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_01_d.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 31,
          "target_step_index": 10
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "じゃ、残りの片付けもちゃっちゃと終わらせよう！\n俺たちも手伝うからさ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "山下 次郎"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
